{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the bridge between the spiritual and the material realms, only you can hear the Moon's call. The Moon Goddess gifted you with the sight to perceive spirits and the power to give them form in the material world. Your task is to seek out her spiritual children, perform the sacred Moon Rites to draw them from the shadows, and build a new world where they can finally exist under the Sun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Two Realms, Day and Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/614ea6bd055c13475eb7aa592e801df6.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/614ea6bd055c13475eb7aa592e801df6.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, explore a hostile material world to gather resources, fight wild creatures, and build your thriving base. As night falls, cross into the spiritual realm to uncover its secrets, find rare materials, recruit spirit allies, and face the unique dangers that lurk in the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit &amp; Bind Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/5259b01e1eaa35cae6ce0650f1702a1b.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/5259b01e1eaa35cae6ce0650f1702a1b.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform lunar rituals to summon spirit companions, each with unique traits and personalities. Have them fight loyally by your side, or bind them directly to your weapons and tools to infuse your gear with their power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo or Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/70d54bf50db5eb53fd3b3f357387e2ee.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/70d54bf50db5eb53fd3b3f357387e2ee.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the wilds alone with your spirit companions or team up with friends in online co-op to explore, build, and survive in a shared world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Your Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/9229049c01f9c276f6cc4c63c27c0582.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/9229049c01f9c276f6cc4c63c27c0582.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a village with help from spirits or friends. Every building part you find in the world can be crafted and used to design and defend your own unique home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Beautiful Procedural Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/81fb3c6c0491c2f57c197a25e9d8e1ae.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/81fb3c6c0491c2f57c197a25e9d8e1ae.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover evolving biomes, delve into dungeons, and challenge mighty bosses in procedural generated worlds inspired by Studio Ghibli.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two realms aren't just visual layers\u2014they\u2019re interdependent ecosystems. Spiritual knowledge and material survival are tightly linked\u2014progress in one realm unlocks new possibilities in the other. Want to build the perfect village? Maximize spirit synergy? Crush every boss with style? The game rewards curiosity and replay, letting you take new paths, discover new builds, and overcome evolving challenges in both worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Please note that Moonrite is a work-in-progress. All footage is from our early alpha build, so graphics and gameplay will evolve before the final release.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398010?t=1760386154","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398010?t=1760386154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/6454d40ee6133ea92c8b5b65fb58bfc6deceee76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760386154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/6454d40ee6133ea92c8b5b65fb58bfc6deceee76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760386154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the bridge between the spiritual and the material realms, only you can hear the Moon's call. The Moon Goddess gifted you with the sight to perceive spirits and the power to give them form in the material world. Your task is to seek out her spiritual children, perform the sacred Moon Rites to draw them from the shadows, and build a new world where they can finally exist under the Sun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Two Realms, Day and Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/614ea6bd055c13475eb7aa592e801df6.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/614ea6bd055c13475eb7aa592e801df6.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, explore a hostile material world to gather resources, fight wild creatures, and build your thriving base. As night falls, cross into the spiritual realm to uncover its secrets, find rare materials, recruit spirit allies, and face the unique dangers that lurk in the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit &amp; Bind Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/5259b01e1eaa35cae6ce0650f1702a1b.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/5259b01e1eaa35cae6ce0650f1702a1b.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform lunar rituals to summon spirit companions, each with unique traits and personalities. Have them fight loyally by your side, or bind them directly to your weapons and tools to infuse your gear with their power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo or Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/70d54bf50db5eb53fd3b3f357387e2ee.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/70d54bf50db5eb53fd3b3f357387e2ee.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the wilds alone with your spirit companions or team up with friends in online co-op to explore, build, and survive in a shared world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Your Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/9229049c01f9c276f6cc4c63c27c0582.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/9229049c01f9c276f6cc4c63c27c0582.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a village with help from spirits or friends. Every building part you find in the world can be crafted and used to design and defend your own unique home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Beautiful Procedural Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/81fb3c6c0491c2f57c197a25e9d8e1ae.poster.avif?t=1760386154\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/81fb3c6c0491c2f57c197a25e9d8e1ae.webm?t=1760386154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover evolving biomes, delve into dungeons, and challenge mighty bosses in procedural generated worlds inspired by Studio Ghibli.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two realms aren't just visual layers\u2014they\u2019re interdependent ecosystems. Spiritual knowledge and material survival are tightly linked\u2014progress in one realm unlocks new possibilities in the other. Want to build the perfect village? Maximize spirit synergy? Crush every boss with style? The game rewards curiosity and replay, letting you take new paths, discover new builds, and overcome evolving challenges in both worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Please note that Moonrite is a work-in-progress. All footage is from our early alpha build, so graphics and gameplay will evolve before the final release.</strong></p>","developers":["Haki Studios"],"ext_user_account_notice":"HAKI STUDIOS LTDA ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/c068b609d3bf48a3a590410881ccd0e1ff5cf9e5/header.jpg?t=1760386154","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Moonrite","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Quad Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB de RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 950 or Radeon HD 7970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Haki Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/39deb1d8a81cced8bfaef1aa79ea8e25bd4fce81/ss_39deb1d8a81cced8bfaef1aa79ea8e25bd4fce81.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760386154","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/39deb1d8a81cced8bfaef1aa79ea8e25bd4fce81/ss_39deb1d8a81cced8bfaef1aa79ea8e25bd4fce81.600x338.jpg?t=1760386154"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/50a45265951b4c5bf44cdef12c47c56a2c7b7515/ss_50a45265951b4c5bf44cdef12c47c56a2c7b7515.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760386154","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/50a45265951b4c5bf44cdef12c47c56a2c7b7515/ss_50a45265951b4c5bf44cdef12c47c56a2c7b7515.600x338.jpg?t=1760386154"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/85c6f068733c85b98cfbddd05d4141685a57a397/ss_85c6f068733c85b98cfbddd05d4141685a57a397.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760386154","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/85c6f068733c85b98cfbddd05d4141685a57a397/ss_85c6f068733c85b98cfbddd05d4141685a57a397.600x338.jpg?t=1760386154"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/c312b548595be6246063777408cb21b57e651243/ss_c312b548595be6246063777408cb21b57e651243.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760386154","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset