ight. Explore and uncover ancient secrets solo or with friends in online co-op to conquer both realms.","steam_appid":3398010,"support_info":{"email":"social@haki.gg","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}